name: Omen Globe — spectral in arcana packs
author: corpus
description: >-
  Omen Globe lets Spectral cards appear in Arcana Packs. Tier-2 voucher: requires Crystal
  Ball bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: spectral in
  tarot packs, Soul hunt, Black Hole hunt, Perkeo setup.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: OmenGlobe
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - spectralCard: TheSoul
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - spectralCard: BlackHole
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Perkeo
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
